   "coverage_note": "Which handler answers an /api/... request: Nitro serves server/api/x.ts at /api/x, so the URL is the path below server/api with the /api prefix Nuxt adds, and the handler is the defineEventHandler() call in that file. The URL is a Route like any other -- the http:*: key space holds one kind -- and it is the handles edge to a ServerHandler, not the entity kind, that says this URL is served by Nitro rather than by a page."
